OL,3,A'It's literally a lottery': Glastonbury
OL,4,A2027 tickets sell out in 40 minutes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTickets for Glastonbury 2027 have sold
OL,7,Fout
OL,9,FA new queuing system was introduced
OL,10,Fthis year, and each registered attendee
OL,11,Fonly got one place in the line - one
OL,12,Ffestival veteran says "it's literally a
OL,13,Flottery"
OL,15,FIf you didn't manage this time around,
OL,16,Fthere's still a bit of hope - thousands
OL,17,Fof volunteers attend the festival each
OL,18,Fyear with organisations like Oxfam and
OL,19,FGreenpeace
